cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "echo-lineage: read-only verification and bounded signed local decisions"
message: "Cite Robert Jordan as the project pseudonym, together with the repository and exact commit used; this is not attribution to a separate person."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Robert Jordan (project pseudonym)"
repository-code: "https://github.com/robertjordan1990/echo-lineage"
license: "Apache-2.0"
keywords:
  - agent provenance
  - lineage verification
  - handoff evidence
  - explicit acceptance
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  A transport-neutral protocol with a read-only verifier that separates
  consistency checks for lineage and handoff evidence from acceptance and
  activation. A separate bounded local Stage 2B candidate records scoped
  operator decisions using pinned Ed25519 keys and never activates a runtime.
  Maintained under the project pseudonym Robert Jordan and developed through
  documented human–AI collaboration within fAIR DecentrAIzation. The pseudonym
  does not identify a separate person or assign copyright ownership. This
  publication snapshot makes no priority claim and does not establish a date
  of first invention. Stage 2A does not authenticate actors or import state.
